#: ../../prior-art.rst:275
msgid ""
"*Where the work goes.* Anubis and Sibuna Gate make the *client* pay "
"before the origin does anything. SafeLine and Cloudflare inspect first "
"and challenge selectively; their default posture is to admit and filter. "
"Sibuna Shield does both, in that order: inspection can deny a request "
"that already holds a valid session."
msgstr ""
"*工作落在哪一方。* Anubis 和 Sibuna Gate 让 *客户端* 在源站做任何事情之前先付出代价。SafeLine 和 "
"Cloudflare 先检查，再有选择地发起挑战；它们的默认立场是先准入再过滤。Sibuna Shield "
"两者都做，并且按这个顺序：即使请求已经持有有效会话，检查仍然可以拒绝它。"

#: ../../prior-art.rst:276
msgid ""
"*What the server remembers.* Anubis keeps challenge state in a store "
"(memory, bbolt, Valkey, or S3) and signs a JSON Web Token with Ed25519; "
"Sibuna issues a self-authenticating record and remembers only solved tags "
"in a fixed table. SafeLine keeps attack logs in PostgreSQL; Cloudflare "
"keeps everything, with sampled visibility on the Free plan."
msgstr ""
"*服务器记住什么。* Anubis 把挑战状态保存在一个存储中（内存、bbolt、Valkey 或 S3），并用 Ed25519 签名 JSON "
"Web Token；Sibuna 签发一个自认证记录，只在一张固定大小的表中记住已解出的标签。SafeLine 把攻击日志保存在 "
"PostgreSQL 中；Cloudflare 保存一切，Free 套餐只提供抽样的可见性。"

#: ../../prior-art.rst:277
msgid ""
"*What an operator has to run.* Sibuna is one binary with an optional "
"SQLite file, or a PostgreSQL database shared by a cluster; Anubis is one "
"Go binary; SafeLine is seven containers behind a Docker daemon on a Linux "
"host with at least one core, one gigabyte of memory, and five gigabytes "
"of disk; Cloudflare is a DNS change and a subscription."
msgstr ""
"*运维人员需要运行什么。* Sibuna 是一个可执行文件，加上可选的 SQLite 文件，或者由集群共享的 PostgreSQL "
"数据库；Anubis 是一个 Go 可执行文件；SafeLine 是七个容器，运行在 Linux 主机的 Docker "
"守护进程之上，主机至少需要一个核心、1 GB 内存和 5 GB 磁盘；Cloudflare 则是一次 DNS 修改加一份订阅。"

#: ../../prior-art.rst:279
msgid "Current product boundary"
msgstr "当前的产品边界"

#: ../../prior-art.rst:282
msgid ""
"The firewall daemon leaves TLS termination to the deployment proxy; the "
"edge terminates TLS itself (Part VIII). Sibuna does not score bots with a "
"trained model or publish paid signatures. The HTTP firewall matches the "
"JA4 fingerprint that a trusted ingress computes and cannot compute one "
"itself (SID 0014, Part XI); the edge computes JA4 only from the "
"ClientHello of a TCP frontend that inspects it, for its routing rules, "
"its hooks and its PROXY header (SID 0015). Its opt-in console provides "
"authenticated dashboards, country enrichment, policy editing, "
"investigation and cluster management. Country lookup and storage work run "
"outside request classification. SID 0007 is Committed, and the console "
"passes its browser workflows (SID 0010). Its formal performance isolation "
"gate, with eight active dashboards under load, is not yet measured; Part "
"VIII records what is."
msgstr ""
"防火墙守护进程把 TLS 终止交给部署中的代理；边缘自己终止 TLS（第 VIII 部分）。Sibuna "
"不用训练好的模型给机器人打分，也不发布付费签名。HTTP 防火墙匹配受信任的入口代理计算出的 JA4 指纹，自己无法计算 JA4（SID "
"0014，第 XI 部分）；边缘只从检查 ClientHello 的 TCP 前端的 ClientHello 计算 JA4，用于其路由规则、钩子和 "
"PROXY 头部（SID "
"0015）。它可选启用的控制台提供需要认证的仪表板、国家信息补充、策略编辑、调查和集群管理。国家查询和存储工作在请求分类之外运行。SID 0007 "
"的状态为 Committed，控制台也通过了浏览器工作流测试（SID "
"0010）。它的正式性能隔离门槛，即在负载下运行八个活动仪表板，尚未测量；已经测得的内容见第 VIII 部分。"

#: ../../prior-art.rst:284
msgid "Load Balancers"
msgstr "负载均衡器"

#: ../../prior-art.rst:287
msgid ""
"Since SID 0015 Sibuna is also an edge load balancer: it forwards TCP and "
"UDP, terminates TLS, HTTP/2 and HTTP/3, and routes HTTP requests to pools "
"of servers, with the firewall on the routes that ask for it. This section "
"names what the load balancer draws on and compares it with two open load "
"balancers."
msgstr ""
"自 SID 0015 起，Sibuna 也是一个边缘负载均衡器：它转发 TCP 和 UDP，终止 TLS、HTTP/2 和 HTTP/3，并把 "
"HTTP 请求路由到服务器池，在要求防火墙的路由上启用防火墙。本节说明负载均衡器借鉴了什么，并把它与两个开源负载均衡器比较。"

#: ../../prior-art.rst:289
msgid "Where the Load Balancer Comes From"
msgstr "负载均衡器的来历"

#: ../../prior-art.rst:292
msgid ""
"The vocabulary is HAProxy's. A *frontend* binds addresses, a *backend* is "
"a pool of *servers*, and an operator drains a server through a local "
"socket with ``set server app/s1 state drain``. Part XI keeps a table that "
"translates HAProxy directives into the keys of the edge. nginx made the "
"event-driven worker the ordinary design of a proxy: a few processes, each "
"with its own event loop, and no thread per connection. SID 0016 builds "
"the HTTP workers of the edge in that way. Envoy made a proxy a "
"programmable platform: filters at fixed points of the path, extensions in "
"WebAssembly, and a configuration that a control plane pushes. The hooks "
"of SID 0030 also attach at fixed stages, in three tiers, and each "
"decision is one call with a deadline."
msgstr ""
"词汇来自 HAProxy。\\ *前端*\\ （frontend）绑定地址，\\ *后端*\\ （backend）是一个由\\ *服务器*\\ "
"（server）组成的服务器池，运维人员通过本地套接字用 ``set server app/s1 state drain`` 排空一台服务器。第 "
"XI 部分保留了一张把 HAProxy 指令翻译为边缘配置键的表。nginx 使事件驱动的 worker "
"成为代理的常规设计：少数几个进程，每个都有自己的事件循环，不为每个连接分配线程。SID 0016 就是以这种方式构建边缘的 HTTP "
"worker。Envoy 使代理成为可编程平台：路径上固定位置的过滤器、WebAssembly 扩展，以及由控制平面推送的配置。SID 0030 "
"的钩子同样挂接在固定的阶段上，分为三个层级，每个决策都是一次带期限的调用。"

#: ../../prior-art.rst:294
msgid "Four papers decide how the edge places a flow and what it remembers."
msgstr "四篇论文决定了边缘如何放置一个流以及它记住什么。"

#: ../../prior-art.rst:296
msgid ""
"*Maglev* (Eisenbud et al., NSDI 2016) fills a table of a prime number of "
"slots from one permutation per server, so a lookup is one hash and one "
"load, and a change of servers moves few clients. The pool kind "
"``bounded_maglev`` builds a weighted table of 65,537 slots "
"(``crates/lb/src/maglev.rs``), and a mesh in its regional regime places "
"clients with it (SID 0015)."
msgstr ""
"*Maglev*\\ （Eisenbud 等，NSDI "
"2016）用每台服务器的一个排列填充一张槽数为素数的表，因此查找只需一次哈希和一次读取，服务器的变化只迁移少量客户端。服务器池类型 "
"``bounded_maglev`` 构建一张 65,537 "
"个槽的加权表（``crates/lb/src/maglev.rs``），处于区域模式的网格用它放置客户端（SID 0015）。"

#: ../../prior-art.rst:297
msgid ""
"*Consistent hashing with bounded loads* (Mirrokni, Thorup and "
"Zadimoghaddam, SODA 2018) caps the load of the chosen server at a factor "
"of the mean and passes the excess on. ``bounded_maglev`` applies such a "
"cap to the server that the table names, with ``load_factor_pct``, 125 by "
"default. HAProxy applies the same idea to its consistent hashing with "
"``hash-balance-factor``."
msgstr ""
"*带有界负载的一致性哈希*\\ （Mirrokni、Thorup 和 Zadimoghaddam，SODA "
"2018）把所选服务器的负载限制在平均值的某个倍数以内，并把超出部分传给下一台。``bounded_maglev`` 用 "
"``load_factor_pct``\\ （默认 125）对表所指定的服务器施加这样的上限。HAProxy 通过 "
"``hash-balance-factor`` 把同样的思想应用于其一致性哈希。"

#: ../../prior-art.rst:298
msgid ""
"*Rendezvous hashing* (Thaler and Ravishankar, IEEE/ACM Transactions on "
"Networking 1998) gives each server a score from a hash of its name and "
"the key, and the largest score wins. Losing a server moves only its own "
"keys and needs no table. Source stickiness ranks servers in this way (SID "
"0019), and peer forwarding chooses the owner of a client among the nodes "
"in this way (SID 0026)."
msgstr ""
"*Rendezvous 哈希*\\ （Thaler 和 Ravishankar，IEEE/ACM Transactions on "
"Networking "
"1998）根据服务器名称和键的哈希给每台服务器一个得分，得分最高者胜出。失去一台服务器只会迁移它自己的键，也不需要表。源地址粘性以这种方式对服务器排序（SID "
"0019），对等转发也以这种方式在节点中选出客户端的所有者（SID 0026）。"

#: ../../prior-art.rst:299
msgid ""
"*TinyLFU* (Einziger, Friedman and Manes, ACM Transactions on Storage "
"2017) admits a new entry to a full cache only when a small frequency "
"sketch says that it is used more often than the entry it would push out. "
"The spill cache of SID 0027 admits hints to its file by this rule."
msgstr ""
"*TinyLFU*\\ （Einziger、Friedman 和 Manes，ACM Transactions on Storage "
"2017）只有当一个小型频率 sketch 表明新条目的使用频率高于它将挤出的条目时，才把新条目准入已满的缓存。SID 0027 "
"的溢出缓存按这一规则把提示准入其文件。"

#: ../../prior-art.rst:302
msgid ""
"HAProxy gives the vocabulary and the admin socket, nginx the event-driven "
"workers, and Envoy shares the idea of hook stages. Maglev and bounded "
"loads give the bounded Maglev pool, rendezvous hashing gives source "
"stickiness and the owner of a client, and TinyLFU gives the admission of "
"the spill cache. HAProxy's hash-balance-factor shares the idea of bounded "
"loads."
msgstr ""
"HAProxy 提供了词汇和管理套接字，nginx 提供了事件驱动的 worker，Envoy 与之共享钩子阶段的思想。Maglev "
"和有界负载产生了有界 Maglev 服务器池，rendezvous 哈希产生了源地址粘性和客户端所有者，TinyLFU "
"产生了溢出缓存的准入。HAProxy 的 hash-balance-factor 与之共享有界负载的思想。"

