"Linux（SID 0029）。或者使用 ``global.reuse_port``"

#: ../../prior-art.rst:383
msgid "The same reload passes the listening sockets to the new process"
msgstr "同样的重新加载把监听套接字传递给新进程"

#: ../../prior-art.rst:384
msgid ""
"Hot restart passes the listening sockets over a Unix socket; existing "
"connections are not transferred; HTTP/3 is not handled gracefully yet"
msgstr "热重启通过 Unix 套接字传递监听套接字；已有连接不会被转移；HTTP/3 尚未得到平滑处理"

#: ../../prior-art.rst:385
msgid "Clustering of state"
msgstr "状态的集群化"

#: ../../prior-art.rst:386
msgid ""
"A mesh of at most 64 nodes shares bans, server commands, the sticky table "
"and fleet-wide ``max_flows``, and forwards each client to its owner node "
"(SID 0022, SID 0025, SID 0026); request limiters count on each node"
msgstr ""
"至多 64 个节点的网格共享封禁、服务器命令、粘性表和集群范围的 ``max_flows``，并把每个客户端转发给其所有者节点（SID "
"0022，SID 0025，SID 0026）；请求限制器在各节点上分别计数"

#: ../../prior-art.rst:387
msgid ""
"``peers`` sections push stick-table entries between instances over TCP, "
"multi-master; values overwrite without aggregation"
msgstr "``peers`` 部分通过 TCP 在实例之间推送 stick 表条目，多主模式；值直接覆盖，不做聚合"

#: ../../prior-art.rst:388
msgid ""
"Global rate limits through an external gRPC rate limit service; other "
"shared state not checked"
msgstr "通过外部 gRPC 速率限制服务实现全局速率限制；其他共享状态未核查"

#: ../../prior-art.rst:389
msgid "Extension mechanism"
msgstr "扩展机制"

#: ../../prior-art.rst:390
msgid ""
"Native Rust hooks, WebAssembly on an in-house metered interpreter, and "
"agents on a Unix socket, at the connection, request and telemetry stages; "
"no hook on a response or a body (SID 0030)"
msgstr ""
"原生 Rust 钩子、运行在自行开发的计量解释器上的 WebAssembly，以及 Unix "
"套接字上的代理，作用于连接、请求和遥测阶段；没有针对响应或请求体的钩子（SID 0030）"

#: ../../prior-art.rst:391
msgid ""
"Lua (``lua-load``); filters, among them the Stream Processing Offload "
"Engine (SPOE)"
msgstr "Lua（``lua-load``）；过滤器，其中包括流处理卸载引擎（SPOE）"

#: ../../prior-art.rst:392
msgid ""
"Filters, among them Lua, external authorization and external processing; "
"WebAssembly through the Proxy-Wasm ABI"
msgstr "过滤器，其中包括 Lua、外部授权和外部处理；通过 Proxy-Wasm ABI 支持 WebAssembly"

#: ../../prior-art.rst:393
msgid "Built-in bot protection"
msgstr "内置机器人防护"

#: ../../prior-art.rst:394
msgid ""
"Proof-of-work admission (Gate) and the semantic firewall (Shield), chosen "
"per frontend and per route; off in ``sibuna lb`` unless asked"
msgstr "工作量证明准入（Gate）和语义防火墙（Shield），按前端和路由选择；在 ``sibuna lb`` 中除非显式要求，否则关闭"

#: ../../prior-art.rst:395
msgid "None in the Configuration Manual; stick-table rates and deny rules"
msgstr "Configuration Manual 中没有；有 stick 表速率和拒绝规则"

#: ../../prior-art.rst:398
msgid "Three differences matter most when we choose."
msgstr "在选型时，有三个差异最为关键。"

#: ../../prior-art.rst:400
msgid ""
"*What changes at run time.* HAProxy and Sibuna both change servers "
"through a local socket. Envoy expects a control plane: its admin "
"interface inspects and drains, and xDS changes the configuration. "
"Sibuna's socket changes servers, bans and certificates of its local "
"authority; frontends, routes and policy change by reload (SID 0018)."
msgstr ""
"*运行时能改变什么。*\\ HAProxy 和 Sibuna 都通过本地套接字修改服务器。Envoy "
"依赖控制平面：它的管理接口用于查看和排空，配置由 xDS 修改。Sibuna "
"的套接字修改服务器、封禁和本地证书颁发机构的证书；前端、路由和策略通过重新加载修改（SID 0018）。"

#: ../../prior-art.rst:401
msgid ""
"*What a cluster shares.* HAProxy replicates stick tables between peers. "
"Sibuna's mesh replicates more kinds of state, each with its own merge "
"rule, and adds fleet-wide caps and peer forwarding, but only within one "
"fixed roster of at most 64 nodes and only on a network that is trusted, "
"because the mesh authenticates and does not encrypt (SID 0026)."
msgstr ""
"*集群共享什么。*\\ HAProxy 在对等实例之间复制 stick 表。Sibuna "
"的网格复制更多种类的状态，每种都有自己的合并规则，还增加了集群范围上限和对等转发，但只限于一个至多 64 "
"个节点的固定成员名单，并且只能在受信任的网络上运行，因为网格只做认证而不加密（SID 0026）。"

#: ../../prior-art.rst:402
msgid ""
"*What a replacement keeps.* All three keep the listening sockets. Sibuna "
"also passes live UDP mappings, so a UDP client keeps its server; none of "
"the three moves an established TCP connection to the new process."
msgstr ""
"*替换时保留什么。*\\ 三者都保留监听套接字。Sibuna 还传递活动的 UDP 映射，因此 UDP 客户端保持其服务器；三者都不会把已建立的 "
"TCP 连接转移到新进程。"

#: ../../prior-art.rst:404
msgid "Current boundary of the load balancer"
msgstr "负载均衡器的当前边界"

#: ../../prior-art.rst:407
msgid ""
"The edge is new. HAProxy and Envoy have served production traffic for "
"years; Sibuna's edge has run in tests and in benchmarks on up to three "
"hosts (Part X). Its known gaps are listed in each SID: among them, TCP "
"and UDP frontends do not consult the ban table, the admin socket cannot "
"change frontends or routes, the spill cache missed the retention target at 50 million distinct keys"
", and an agent call at the request stage holds its thread."
msgstr ""
"边缘是新的。HAProxy 和 Envoy 已经服务生产流量多年；Sibuna 的边缘只在测试中以及至多三台主机的基准测试中运行过（第 X "
"部分）。它的已知不足列在每个 SID 中：其中包括 TCP 和 UDP "
"前端不查询封禁表、管理套接字无法修改前端或路由、溢出缓存在五千万个不同键的测试中未达到保留率目标，以及请求阶段的代理调用会占住它的线程。"

#: ../../prior-art.rst:409
msgid "Exercise 2.1"
msgstr "练习 2.1"

#: ../../prior-art.rst:411
msgid ""
"Explain why compiling one verifier source to native code and WebAssembly "
"reduces protocol drift. Which properties still require independent "
"testing or cryptographic review?"
msgstr "解释为什么把同一份验证器源码同时编译为原生代码和 WebAssembly 可以减少协议漂移。哪些性质仍然需要独立测试或密码学审查？"

#: ../../prior-art.rst:413
msgid "Exercise 2.2"
msgstr "练习 2.2"

#: ../../prior-art.rst:415
msgid ""
"Using only the comparison tables, write down the smallest deployment that "
"gives a static site (a) a proof-of-work gate, (b) SQL-injection "
"inspection, and (c) a cluster-wide ban. Which rows forced each choice?"
msgstr ""
"只使用比较表，写出能为一个静态网站提供以下功能的最小部署：(a) 工作量证明网关，(b) SQL 注入检查，(c) "
"集群范围的封禁。每个选择是由哪几行决定的？"

#: ../../prior-art.rst:417
msgid "Hint: Start from the \"runs as\" and \"multi-node\" rows."
msgstr "提示：从“运行形式”和“多节点”两行开始。"

#: ../../prior-art.rst:419
msgid "Exercise 2.3"
msgstr "练习 2.3"

#: ../../prior-art.rst:421
msgid ""
"A pool has four servers of equal weight and 1,000 clients. Using only the "
"descriptions of Maglev and rendezvous hashing above, say how many clients "
"move when one server is removed under each scheme, and why peer "
"forwarding (SID 0026) chose rendezvous hashing for the owner of a client."
msgstr ""
"一个服务器池有四台等权重服务器和 1,000 个客户端。只根据上文对 Maglev 和 rendezvous "
"哈希的描述，说出在每种方案下删除一台服务器时有多少客户端迁移，以及对等转发（SID 0026）为什么选择 rendezvous "
"哈希来确定客户端的所有者。"

#: ../../prior-art.rst:423
msgid ""
"Hint: Ask which clients a removal must move, and which ones a rebuilt "
"table may move as well."
msgstr "提示：想一想删除操作必须迁移哪些客户端，以及重建的表还可能迁移哪些客户端。"

#: ../../prior-art.rst:425
msgid "Explain the invariant"
msgstr "解释这个不变量"

#: ../../prior-art.rst:427
msgid ""
"Describe how Gate, Shield, and optional shared storage divide admission, "
"inspection and policy distribution. Then name one row of the comparison "
"tables we would want to re-verify before quoting it to a customer, and "
"say how we would verify it."
msgstr ""
"描述 Gate、Shield "
"和可选的共享存储如何划分准入、检查和策略分发。然后指出比较表中我们在向客户引用之前想要重新核实的一行，并说明我们会如何核实它。"

